{"reviews":[{"id":"B08YP589T5-0","r":5.0,"t":"Beyond expectations","x":"[[VIDEOID:3a7c8884c0f91745ca218d50a5ccc7ae]] I'm shocked at how good this is! I'm picky on red lipstick! It really is transfer proof! It smells like hot chocolate to me, which is better than a strong chemical smell.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-1","r":5.0,"t":"Very vibrant","x":"I love this ! Went to try a bold color for the first time in my young adult life my daughter says I look like Snow White and I\u2019m loving it !!","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-2","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful color","x":"I\u2019m more into the deep mauve tones but I bought a dress for an upcoming wedding so I decided to try red since part of my dress is red . The color dries quickly and is transfer proof I haven\u2019t checked to see how long it lasts as of yet but it\u2019s a beautiful color and doesn\u2019t make your teeth look yellow.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-3","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing!! Best Red!!","x":"I love it so much!! I\u2019ve been trying to find a pretty red without being an orange red if that makes sense. This is perfect\ud83d\ude0d","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great!!","x":"Tried it right away. Perfect matte without over dryness. You couldn\u2019t wipe it off. I used Vaseline and baby wipes to completely remove it","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-5","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful lipstick","x":"Absolutely love this lipstick!!! It\u2019s definitely worth the money \ud83d\udcb0","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-6","r":5.0,"t":"Love this lipstick","x":"True red! Smooth application and smells amazing. Doesn\u2019t bleed or smudge as long as you don\u2019t layer it with lip gloss. I\u2019d definitely buy again!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-7","r":1.0,"t":"Smears badly","x":"Horrible lip product, smears easily and I wound up looking like Bette Davis in Whatever Happened to Baby Jane.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-8","r":2.0,"t":"Color is good. but Beware","x":"So it is good. the color is great. and it is what it says....  The only bad thang is  it taste like a dead anamal.  but just like most. ... Ewww","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-9","r":5.0,"t":"Staying power and actually red","x":"FINALLY an actual red lipstick!!! It stays in place and looks great!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-10","r":3.0,"t":"Lip liner is nice the lip gloss not so much","x":"I like liner, the lip gloss is nice at first & the color. it smells like cake-batter a little which is cool\u2026. it does quickly become clumpy & kinda tacky on the lips and that makes it a lot lower quality also it stains your lips and skin very bad like will stay on your lips for 3/4 days no matter how much u wash it off or use makeup wipes also the skin around your lips","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-11","r":5.0,"t":"This is worth more hype than the Kylie lip kit","x":"Love it!  I picked scarlet red and I can honestly say this is the best red lipstick I have ever gotten!  The color is just as vibrant as I was hoping for.  Also, can we talk about the smell?  It smells AMAZINGGGG like vanilla!  Other red lipsticks I\u2019ve tried in the past had a chemical smell but this smells so luscious.  Recommend!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great lipstick!!","x":"I love this lipstick! The color is just beautiful and really matte. The applicator goes on smoothly and it doesn't stain glasses while drinking nor it doesn't feel dry after a while. The color stayed put even after eating and drinking. The lip liner is really good as well. I just love this lipstick.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great color but it does smudge if you touch it","x":"Pleasantly surprised by this kit. Didn't expect much from a cheap amazon lipstick but the color is great (and smells like vanilla) it does last a long time if you don't touch it. I only did some touch ups after dinner, but it does smear A LOT of you happen to rub it (definitely not kiss proof).","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-14","r":1.0,"t":"Opened and Used","x":"The package was already opened and the liner was loose in the shipping envelope. When I took the cap off (no plastic packaging around it), it had already been previously used as evidenced by the smudges on the part of the pencil that gets sharpened. Absolutely disgusting.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great","x":"I wasn\u2019t expecting to love it but I do. I\u2019m not a big lipstick person but I bought this to use on Halloween, it lasted all night. Made it through all the drinking and eating. Loved the color and everything so much I have worn it a few times since.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-16","r":5.0,"t":"Love, love, love!","x":"I absolutely adore this product. It does what it says it will. Applies easily, doesn\u2019t clump, doesn\u2019t zap all of the moisture out of your lips, and the color is fun. This is my new go-to for long lasting matte color.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-17","r":5.0,"t":"Best red lip color ever!","x":"The color pops! The price is friendly and after drinks or dinner I just reapply some touch ups. It is difficult to remove completely. I recommend an oil base makeup remover; the kind that works on waterproof makeup.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-18","r":5.0,"t":"This is great","x":"When I got this I was so excited,was hoping for bright red but it's deep red still great product I previously reviewed this and wrote bad review was intended for another product so sorry clicked the wrong one\ud83e\udd26\u200d\u2640\ufe0f","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-19","r":2.0,"t":"They are not sealed","x":"I have to return since these items seems to have been opened, they are not not sealed. I can\u2019t tell if they have been used, and I do t want to take any chances. Too bad, nice color","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-20","r":4.0,"t":"Didnt dry down","x":"I love the color of his product as well as a lip liner went on very smoothly and lasts for a while. Unfortunately the product did not dry down and is did transfer quite a bit","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-21","r":2.0,"t":"Cracks and wrinkles","x":"Beautiful colors. Applies easy. But visible wrinkles/cracks on lips make it soo ugly. What am I doing wrong. Dont wear makeup often.. was trying something new.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-22","r":3.0,"t":"Drunk clown","x":"The color is fabulous! The product smears from lips before any kissing or eating. \ud83e\udd37Oh! To find a color this perfect in a lipstick/stain that stays where put!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-23","r":5.0,"t":"Better then expected!","x":"Absolutely loved it! Wasn\u2019t really expecting much with the price and getting it from Amazon but I was thoroughly impressed! Getting it in a different shade.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B08YP589T5-24","r":5.0,"t":"Worked Great for Dance Recital","x":"It stayed on my daughter's lips for her entire dance recital. This alone makes the product a miracle. The color popped. It will be my go-to from now on.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the vibrant, true red color and matte finish.","cites":[2,3,4,7,10,12,13]},{"text":"Many reviewers report strong staying power and transfer-proof wear, though some note it smears if touched or rubbed.","cites":[1,3,5,7,8,13,14]},{"text":"The scent is commonly described as pleasant, like vanilla or hot chocolate, rather than chemical.","cites":[1,7,12,14]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain about taste, clumping/tackiness, or staining that lasts for days.","cites":[9,11]},{"text":"One reviewer received a product that appeared previously opened and used.","cites":[15]}]},"qa":[]}